1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:12,000
In this video, we will share with you the techniques and problem-solving solutions of the automatic adjustment board tool group.

2
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:16,000
The automatic adjustment board tool can allow you to reuse assets on multiple projects or models.

3
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Please remember, when you need to use the automatic adjustment board function, please try to make the lines and structures of the clothing as simple as possible, and avoid too much fine-tuning before using this function.

4
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:38,000
For example, for the bottom of this skirt, I need to make it level, because if it is adapted to multiple models, the original line may become more and more crooked.

5
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:52,000
In addition, if I want to set up a file that needs to be automatically adjusted on the outside of the skirt, such as a sweater, but this sweater has not used the automatic adjustment board function, and the skirt has already used it.

6
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:55,000
We suggest that we set up another project for the sweater.

7
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:58,000
In this case, we will use the automatic adjustment board function.

8
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:08,000
Because if there is already another dress in the scene, and then use the automatic adjustment board for the new dress, it may cause the position or size of the clothes to change.

9
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:13,000
I will use the automatic adjustment board tool to let you check the possible problems that may occur.

10
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:16,000
After completion, we will see that the board has been modified.

11
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:22,000
Hiding the sweater, we will see some changes in this skirt, which is not the effect we want.

12
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:25,000
You will find that the front and back of this skirt are different.

13
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:33,000
At the same time, it may cause such problems when using the automatic adjustment board for the clothes that have already been modified and those that have not been automatically adjusted.

14
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:40,000
Therefore, if you want to automatically adjust the files in multiple projects, please try to separate the automatic adjustment and then integrate them together.

15
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:50,000
If you encounter this notification when trying to use the automatic adjustment board tool, and only use the pre-registered virtual model, then there are two things to be confirmed.

16
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:52,000
Is there a virtual model in this project?

17
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:56,000
Is there a virtual model on your virtual model?

18
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:59,000
Please confirm that there is a virtual model in the current project.

19
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:01,000
If not, please import one.

20
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:04,000
Then go to the virtual model display option in the 3D window.

21
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:09,000
Click on the virtual model display to see if there is a virtual model in the virtual model.

22
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:17,000
If there is no black grid-like virtual model around your virtual model, then please use the creative virtual model tool to create a virtual model for your virtual model.

23
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:20,000
If there is a clothing file in your current scene,

24
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:24,000
when you choose to create a virtual model for your virtual model, a prompt will pop up.

25
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:27,000
The file has not been saved. Do you want to save the file?

26
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:29,000
In this video, I will choose no.

27
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:32,000
Then the clothing in the work area will be deleted.

28
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:34,000
The history record has also been deleted.

29
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:40,000
If you have just saved the clothing or project file and have not modified it afterwards, you will not receive this prompt.

30
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:42,000
Your clothing has been emptied.

31
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:47,000
Since you have saved it before, it will not prompt you to perform the operation of saving again.

32
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:49,000
Only after the clothing is emptied can you normally use the creative virtual model tool.

33
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:54,000
In the work area, you need no clothing to add the information for the virtual model.

34
00:02:54,000 --> 00:03:00,000
Since the clothing and history records will be emptied, please save your project file before using this function.

35
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:05,000
We recommend that you directly create a project, enter the virtual model file, and start creating a virtual model.

36
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:12,000
If you want to use the automatic wear or automatic adjustment version, the prompt pops up.

37
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:15,000
Only the clothing that is used for simulation is used.

38
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:19,000
Usually, this means that the current clothing does not have the information for creating a virtual model.

39
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:21,000
Therefore, please check it.

40
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:23,000
Please go to the 3D display window.

41
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:28,000
In the clothing display option, click on the display clothing to check.

42
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:36,000
Here I open the display clothing, but you will find that there is no clothing with a red grid in our scene.

43
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:43,000
Because this set of clothing is an old file I made in Marvelous Designer 8 or 7, so it does not have the information for wearing clothes.

44
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:47,000
If your clothing file does not have the information for wearing clothes, such as the one downloaded from the website or the old version of Marvelous Designer 8 or 7.

45
00:03:47,000 --> 00:03:52,000
In this case, the clothing cannot use the automatic adjustment version or automatic wear directly.

46
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:58,000
If you want to solve this problem, please wear the clothing in the model with the information for wearing clothes.

47
00:03:58,000 --> 00:04:03,000
In the current version, the MoYue virtual model that our software brings with it is with the information for wearing clothes.

48
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:08,000
Therefore, here I will simulate the clothing on the male virtual model brought by the software.

49
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:12,000
After the simulation is complete, I will save the clothing file again.

50
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:15,000
Before saving the file, you will not be able to see it.

51
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:19,000
Before saving the file, you will not be able to see the information for wearing clothes on the clothing.

52
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:28,000
I will save the whole project file and then open this file again to let you see the information for wearing clothes.

53
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:33,000
When I open this file again, you will see the red grid structure around the clothing.

54
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:36,000
This is the information for wearing clothes.

55
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:38,000
Thank you for watching this tutorial.

56
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:42,000
If you have any tutorials or questions, please leave a message in the comments section below.

57
00:04:42,000 --> 00:04:44,000
See you in the next video, bye.

58
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:47,000
Thank you for watching this video.

